              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la critica — \"the criticism; the critics\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Accetto la critica, ma il lavoro è finito. I accept the criticism, but the work is finished."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Fare una critica — to make a criticism. La critica can also mean the critics as a group."
            }
          ]
        },
