          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "critica is built on critico, a learned borrowing from Latin criticus \"able to judge\" (Lewis & Short), from Greek kritikós, from krínein \"to separate, to decide\"."
            }
